From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: point sourcemap urls at vscodium's github releases

VSCodium cannot publish to Microsoft's private main.vscode-cdn.net, so sourcemaps are hosted on VSCodium's own GitHub releases instead (#2545). The build quality is added to the release tag to keep stable and insider assets from colliding, and path separators are flattened to dashes because GitHub release asset names cannot contain slashes.

